  "id": "child-with-special-needs",
  "term": "child with special needs",
  "definition": "A child with special needs is a child whose physical, psychological, or social needs require family members to adjust daily life and routines to provide care and support. In this context, the term refers to children whose care demands can create substantial practical and emotional strain for parents and the family.",
